    </member>
    <member name="T:System.Web.UI.MobileControls.TextControl">
      <summary>The base <see cref="T:System.Web.UI.MobileControls.TextControl" /> class is an abstract class from which concrete text-based controls are derived. For information about how to develop ASP.NET mobile applications, see the www.asp.net/mobile Web site.</summary>
    </member>
    <member name="T:System.Web.UI.MobileControls.TextView">
