      <exception cref="T:System.InvalidOperationException">An <see cref="T:System.Xml.XmlWriter" /> method was called before a previous asynchronous operation finished. In this case, <see cref="T:System.InvalidOperationException" /> is thrown with the message â€œAn asynchronous operation is already in progress.â€</exception>
    </member>
