                The <see cref="P:System.IdentityModel.Tokens.SamlAuthorizationDecisionStatement.AccessDecision" />   property is set and the <see cref="P:System.IdentityModel.Tokens.SamlAuthorizationDecisionStatement.IsReadOnly" /> property is <see langword="true" />.</returns>
    </member>
    <member name="P:System.IdentityModel.Tokens.SamlAuthorizationDecisionStatement.ClaimType">
