          <see cref="T:System.AddIn.Pipeline.FrameworkElementAdapters" /> is used by Windows Presentation Foundation (WPF) add-ins to convert between a <see cref="T:System.Windows.FrameworkElement" /> and anÂ <see cref="T:System.AddIn.Contract.INativeHandleContract" />.</summary>
