 –ºIZ␀€␀€     <summary>Implements <see cref="T:System.Data.IDataRecord" /> and <see cref="T:System.ComponentModel.ICustomTypeDescriptor" />, and provides data binding support for <see cref="T:System.Data.Common.DbEnumerator" />.</summary>
