            <see langword="true" /> if the call originates while processing a page request. <see langword="false" /> if the caller is an HTTP module. This parameter determines how to terminate processing or send redirects if the incoming message is a WS-Federation sign-out cleanup message (â€œwsignoutcleanup1.0â€).</param>
