      <summary>Initializes a new instance of the <see cref="T:System.Windows.Forms.DataVisualization.Charting.DataPoint" /> class§0—␀€␀€ with the specified X and Y-value.</summary>
      <param name="xValue">The X-value of the data point.</param>
      <param name="yValue">The Y-value of the data point.</param>
